      "excerpt": "there be a prophet among you, I the Lord will make myself known unto him in a vision, and will speak unto him in a dream. My servant Moses is not so, who is faithful in all mine house, with him will I speak mouth to mout",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
