      "contentSha256": "f8650ac6f92e9d3ccc2b1cbf873f4e3ddffe335543ae6ce6bbc07b825c445dcb",
      "excerpt": "Do not let us undertake to follow them for fear of falling into like frivolities; let them refute each other, and, without disquieting ourselves about essence, let us say with Moses “God created the heavens and the earth",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
