      "contentSha256": "31e46d1a09a331a1908a3b495b08c3d96c0bb5164621963051c29c5b76a0544b",
      "excerpt": "Well, then, I retorted, we only exchange one paradox for another by arguing in this way; for our reason will be reduced to the conclusion that the Deity and the Mind of man are identical, if it be true that neither can b",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-07",
      "passageId": "passage_587b24a75d24cfdd01f3f6a83d28a773",
