      "contentSha256": "df7611b0e7615e417e257010a2cc917ea0469bc042738d19e179ecaca810fedd",
      "excerpt": "artifice, and to think that the very ingenuity of it is trying to bias our judgment and to upset the truth. If on the other hand any one will accept a discussion which is in a naked unsyllogistic form, we will speak upon",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-07",
      "passageId": "passage_20970ff5facbdf43c4b642d62c865f14",
