      "contentSha256": "84233b17f724cd9e572ea69b9c19a438de6e5c1cf3a9a959dde7f139925df726",
      "excerpt": "You see, she replied, there is a battle of the reason with them and a struggle to rid the soul of them; and there are men in whom this struggle has ended in success; it was so with Moses, as we know; he was superior both",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-08",
