      "contentSha256": "a24270257228c6f2976cc0e03f023c8f5dad337fae28c938eb3530846bd8df00",
      "excerpt": "The Teacher answered: The expressions of that narrative of the Word are certainly material; but still many hints are interspersed in it to rouse the skilled inquirer to a more discriminating study of it. I mean that He W",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-08",
