      "locator": "Source paragraph 059",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "role": "DIRECT_ANSWER",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/2915.htm",
      "contentSha256": "0b0091450402ce0097aa12be66cdc456984a0bb61a39cb0265a72d812850fe69",
      "excerpt": "I think, she replied, that the Gospel signifies by means of each of them certain doctrines with regard to our question of the soul. For when the patriarch first says to the Rich Man, You in your lifetime received your go",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-08",
