      "locator": "Source paragraph 054",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "role": "SUPPORTING_CONTEXT",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/2915.htm",
      "contentSha256": "5fd8b97800ff57f45d999e80710f45e3d74955b58b2a7e7eb2a59f4b2c7be3f1",
      "excerpt": "Then to meet such an objection, I rejoined, the above opinion about the soul will, as I said, avail; namely, that she remains after dissolution in those very atoms in which she first grew up, and, like a guardian placed ",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-09",
      "passageId": "passage_2b61c4d3c9020f81ef53655577a4a127",
