      "sourceUrl": "https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/2915.htm",
      "contentSha256": "b2ccf4889fe062da86cefeb228f96b3373e09c3c8e4aeb1429074791447c4c76",
      "excerpt": "That is very true, the Teacher replied. For we may hear these opponents urging the following difficulty. The atoms are resolved, like to like, into the universe; by what device, then, does the warmth, for instance, resid",
      "editorialStatus": "SOURCE_EXCERPT_REVIEWED_NOT_DOCTRINALLY_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "gregory-10",
      "passageId": "passage_898af8210c45ec5f730043d127e46ad8",
